item('Physical AI needs digital-twin-first workflows','physical ai','2026-09-03','https://www.fanucamerica.com/press-releases/fanuc-america-brings-robotics-automation-physical-ai-and-cnc-innovation-to-imts-2026','FANUC showcases natural-language robot programming, sensor-linked reasoning, digital twins, and virtual commissioning.','Simulation reduces the cost of experimenting with real-world agents.','Use plan → simulate → verify → deploy for high-cost automation.','Digital twins offer a safer test surface for embodied workflows.','This is a demonstration, not proof of general autonomy.','Keep operator approval and hard interlocks.'),
